  "content_id": "16136143",
  "title": "LetsExchange – Exchange Integration in Edge Wallet",
  "description": "Type: Centralized Exchange (CEX)\nCentralized exchanges must follow anti-money laundering (AML) laws. In order to stay within compliance, t...",
  "body": "<p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Type:</b> Centralized Exchange (CEX)</p><p class=\"no-margin\">Centralized exchanges must follow anti-money laundering (AML) laws. In order to stay within compliance, they may have trading limits and may also require your identity to meet Know Your Customer (KYC) requirements.</p><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Overview:</b> LetsExchange is an instant cryptocurrency exchange that supports crypto swaps without registration under most conditions. LetsExchange allows fast swaps without account registration, but users may be required to complete KYC if flagged for risk or when requested by third-party exchange partners. Users in restricted jurisdictions are blocked. For compliance inquiries, contact <a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"intercom-content-link\">legal@letsexchange.io</a>. LetsExchange is a fast, registration-free crypto exchange platform offering a wide range of coins and pairs. It’s designed for quick, easy swaps with competitive rates and no upper limits.</p><h1 id=\"h_01JSFXMT5RRR5N2EG5ESKADM03\">How to Manage Exchange Settings in Edge</h1><p class=\"no-margin\">To access your exchange settings in Edge Wallet:</p><ol><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Tap the <b>three lines</b> in the upper right-hand corner</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Tap on <b>Settings</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Tap <b>Exchange Settings</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Here, you can turn exchange partners <b>on or off</b>, and customize your preferences. When multiple exchanges can fill an order, you can also choose to automatically select the best price or prioritize a preferred exchange.</p></li></ol>",
  "author_id": 9849332,
